OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fscattered showers at first, heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes, but these gradually fading out
OL,8,Fthrough the evening. Dry spells and
OL,9,Fthe odd light shower overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FCloudy with dry spells and
OL,12,Fa few light showers at first.
OL,13,FScattered showers or longer spells of
OL,14,Frain in the afternoon, heavy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
