OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FCloudy start with a few light showers
OL,7,FThursday morning, then a mostly dry
OL,8,Fand bright afternoon. Bright start
OL,9,FFriday, showers later. Dry interludes
OL,10,Fbetween spells of showery rain on
OL,11,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
